# 20251203_todo-webapp

A simple TODO web application created on 2025-12-03.

Overview

This repository contains a small TODO web application to track tasks. It includes source code, configurations, and instructions to run the app locally and in production.

Features

- Create, edit, and delete tasks
- Mark tasks as completed
- (Optional) Persist tasks to a database or local storage

