Getting started

Prerequisites

- Node.js (>= 14) and npm/yarn, if the project uses Node
- A database, if the app requires one (see repository-specific docs)

Clone the repo

    git clone https://github.com/Yoshiki785/20251203_todo-webapp.git
    cd 20251203_todo-webapp

Install dependencies

If the project uses npm:

    npm install

Or with yarn:

    yarn install

Environment

Create a .env file from .env.example if present and update configuration values (port, database URL, etc.).

Run the app

For a typical Node-based project in development mode:

    npm run dev

Or build and start:

    npm run build
    npm start

Testing

Run tests (if any):

    npm test

